+## 10. prod-sampling plan (round 4 onward)
+
+Per the item: after B-greedy, run `off prod` and the winner of A/B (by dual-agent greedy
+decode tok/s) as `prod` — agent temp 1.0 / top_p 0.95 / top_k 20, mem temp 0.2, both seed 0.
+`off prod` is still pending regardless of the A/B outcome (required by the acceptance list).
+Report combined per-slot throughput over phase wall time (dual phases include the other slot's
+prefill stalls in predicted_ms) when summarizing.
